SQL> -- 11 WAQTD NUMBER OF EMPS AND TOTAL SALARY NEEDED TO PAY THE EMPLOYEES WHO HAVE 2 CONSICUTIVE L's IN THEIR NAMES.
SQL> SELECT COUNT(*) AS NUM_EMP, SUM(SAL) TOTAL_SAL
  2  FROM EMP
  3  WHERE ENAME LIKE '%LL%';

   NUM_EMP  TOTAL_SAL                                                                               
---------- ----------                                                                               
         2       2900                                                                               

